description	"Imperial Snowtrooper

Cold weather specialists, immune to being frozen, they use their equipment to that advantage.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- SE-14C Blaster Pistol (2)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Env Protection (2)
- Blast Armor
- Close Combat Training (3)

^8Abilities:
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]"